WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:04.710
Very few people would enjoy getting eaten
by a bear in the woods.

00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:09.290
That would undeniably be an extremely unpleasant
thing to happen to anyone.

00:00:09.290 --> 00:00:13.900
Heck, it’s certainly enough to put a damper
on an otherwise fun weekend of camping.

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:18.300
But the one consolation of undergoing such
a tragedy is that you at least know nature

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:20.300
is taking its course.

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:23.939
After all, bears live in the woods, and if
you decide to enter their turf, there’s

00:00:23.939 --> 00:00:28.090
an unwritten agreement that you’ll just
accept the consequences if a bear decides

00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:29.769
it doesn’t want your company.

00:00:29.769 --> 00:00:34.840
It’s another thing entirely if a bear eats
you in your bedroom, in the middle of suburbia,

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:37.440
miles away from any nearby forest.

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:41.399
That’s the unfortunate fate that befell
little Tommy Ellis.

00:00:41.399 --> 00:00:45.809
His parents heard the bellowing roar of a
bear upstairs, the floorboards creaking under

00:00:45.809 --> 00:00:47.309
its sudden weight.

00:00:47.309 --> 00:00:48.700
What was happening up there?

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:53.940
They ran upstairs, following the sounds of
the roars and Tommy’s horrible screams.

00:00:53.940 --> 00:00:59.260
But by the time they reached the bedroom,
it was already too late: The room was empty,

00:00:59.260 --> 00:01:04.430
torn apart from within, as a six hundred pound
grizzly bear crawled its way out of the destroyed

00:01:04.430 --> 00:01:05.860
bedroom window.

00:01:05.860 --> 00:01:08.830
Tommy Ellis was never seen again…

00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:14.159
To Tommy’s parents, before they were given
Amnestic treatment by agents of the SCP Foundation,

00:01:14.159 --> 00:01:16.640
it was a freakish one-off tragedy.

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:21.189
But to those very same Foundation agents,
it was just another instance in a series of

00:01:21.189 --> 00:01:26.590
deaths so strange and random that only some
kind of anomalous serial killer could be behind

00:01:26.590 --> 00:01:27.590
it.

00:01:27.590 --> 00:01:32.420
Two months earlier in a nearby town, a family
had undergone a savage attack from a full-sized

00:01:32.420 --> 00:01:34.440
male silverback gorilla.

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:39.310
The huge and heavily territorial animal tore
the house apart, and beat anyone who tried

00:01:39.310 --> 00:01:41.460
to stop it into a pulp.

00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:45.930
Much like a bear attack, being killed by an
aggressive gorilla in the wild isn’t that

00:01:45.930 --> 00:01:51.070
strange - but being murdered by a gorilla
in the suburbs of Cincinnati is definitely

00:01:51.070 --> 00:01:53.560
a cause for Foundation intervention.

00:01:53.560 --> 00:01:58.340
However, the gorilla killer was long gone
before any Foundation agents were able to

00:01:58.340 --> 00:01:59.340
intervene.

00:01:59.340 --> 00:02:03.810
At first, it was assumed that they were dealing
with some kind of animal SCP, but as more

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:08.820
grisly murders occurred, it began to paint
a better picture of what exactly was happening

00:02:08.820 --> 00:02:09.820
here.

00:02:09.820 --> 00:02:13.770
Next, a family was found dead after what seemed
to be a brutal attack with an edged weapon

00:02:13.770 --> 00:02:20.330
- but this was no mere knife; all evidence
pointed to the weapon being a sword.

00:02:20.330 --> 00:02:24.200
Neighbors interviewed by the Foundation about
the attack before their amnestic treatment

00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:29.190
reported hearing a frightening ruckus coming
from the house next door, including a deep,

00:02:29.190 --> 00:02:33.080
male voice saying, “I HAVE THE POWER!”

00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:37.970
Much like He-Man, from the popular toy and
animation franchise.

00:02:37.970 --> 00:02:41.940
This reminded them of another recent murder
case where the killer also reportedly used

00:02:41.940 --> 00:02:47.430
a sword - though this time more likely a Japanese
Katana than a European Broadsword - and was

00:02:47.430 --> 00:02:51.340
heard yelling “Cowabunga!” as they left
the scene.

00:02:51.340 --> 00:02:54.530
As the bodies racked up, the evidence kept
piling on.

00:02:54.530 --> 00:02:59.440
A young girl was traumatized by a naked man
suddenly appearing in her bedroom.

00:02:59.440 --> 00:03:05.830
This would be horrible enough, but there were
a few strange details: He was handsome, athletic,

00:03:05.830 --> 00:03:08.900
had bright blond hair, and no genitals.

00:03:08.900 --> 00:03:12.720
In fact, he matched the exact description
of a child’s Ken doll.

00:03:12.720 --> 00:03:16.840
And the thing that finally tied this whole
bizarre case together was an entire family

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:21.570
who were found to have been killed by electrocution
- despite all being in different rooms of

00:03:21.570 --> 00:03:26.480
the house at their time of death, and showing
no evidence of having been moved post-mortem.

00:03:26.480 --> 00:03:31.150
But the family’s youngest, Steven, had a
number of Pokemon cards

00:03:31.150 --> 00:03:36.320
and action figures in his room, prominently
featuring the franchise’s most well-known

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:38.220
creature: Pikachu.

00:03:38.220 --> 00:03:42.760
This shapeshifting, rampaging killer was caught
not long afterward when a full-sized pony

00:03:42.760 --> 00:03:48.380
suddenly manifested in the home of another
suburban family - thankfully causing no fatalities

00:03:48.380 --> 00:03:51.520
this time - and galloped off into the woods.

00:03:51.520 --> 00:03:55.470
Seeing as the Foundation was already keeping
a close watch on the area to make sure they

00:03:55.470 --> 00:03:59.910
caught any more strange activity, they were
able to quickly engage with and capture this

00:03:59.910 --> 00:04:01.590
strange entity.

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:06.620
It was then sedated and sent back into containment
at the iconic Site-19.

00:04:06.620 --> 00:04:08.880
The creature is now known as SCP-137.

00:04:08.880 --> 00:04:13.520
So, you’re probably wondering: What exactly
is happening here?

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:18.459
What are the anomalous traits of SCP-137,
that appear to express themselves in such

00:04:18.459 --> 00:04:20.720
random and violent ways?

00:04:20.720 --> 00:04:25.730
While it may seem that 137’s abilities are
as diverse as they are dangerous, it actually

00:04:25.730 --> 00:04:29.370
only has one, very simple anomalous power.

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:34.330
It possesses the toys of children and transforms
them into their real-life equivalent.

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:39.970
A teddy bear became an actual bear, a stuffed
gorilla became an actual gorilla, toys of

00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:45.570
He-Man and a member of the Teenage Mutant
Ninja Turtles became murderous sword-wielders,

00:04:45.570 --> 00:04:50.120
and Pikachu became a wild animal with powerful
electrical abilities.

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:53.930
The SCP doesn’t appear to be inherently
violent, either.

00:04:53.930 --> 00:04:57.970
Its level of aggression appears to be in the
eye of the beholder, as the attributes of

00:04:57.970 --> 00:05:04.120
the toys possessed by SCP-137 are defined
by what a child perceives about said toy.

00:05:04.120 --> 00:05:09.650
For example, a pretend gun becomes a real
one, capable of firing real bullets.

00:05:09.650 --> 00:05:15.030
Toys of dangerous animals become equally deadly
in their real SCP-137 counterpart.

00:05:15.030 --> 00:05:18.000
Warriors and soldiers become powerful killing
machines.

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:20.790
However, this works both ways.

00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:26.620
Adorable or harmless characters remain equally
adorable and harmless when SCP-137 possesses

00:05:26.620 --> 00:05:27.620
them.

00:05:27.620 --> 00:05:31.650
It seems as though the entity that possesses
these toys doesn’t even have a consciousness

00:05:31.650 --> 00:05:35.410
- it only takes up the mental attributes of
its hosts.

00:05:35.410 --> 00:05:39.460
Incidentally, this was actually a crucial
factor in devising the proper containment

00:05:39.460 --> 00:05:42.140
method for SCP-137 within Site-19.

00:05:42.140 --> 00:05:47.780
Through testing, the Foundation discovered
that SCP-137’s anomalous range is at least

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:52.650
250 meters, with a possible upper limit of
500 meters.

00:05:52.650 --> 00:05:57.120
In order to keep the creature in a consistent
and harmless form, the Foundation forbids

00:05:57.120 --> 00:06:02.330
any unauthorized toy from being placed within
the 500-meter radius of SCP-137.

00:06:02.330 --> 00:06:08.500
Essentially, the Foundation has boxed SCP-137
into a corner, meaning that any toy placed

00:06:08.500 --> 00:06:11.750
within its anomalous proximity is its only
option.

00:06:11.750 --> 00:06:18.140
In this case, the Foundation has locked SCP-137
into the form of a wholesome princess doll,

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:20.810
identifying itself as Princess Blossom.

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:25.130
When asked about its identity in this form,
the creature seems to have no awareness whatsoever

00:06:25.130 --> 00:06:27.280
of its anomalous nature.

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:33.680
SCP-137 truly believes it is Princess Blossom
while occupying this form, repeatedly asking

00:06:33.680 --> 00:06:37.740
interviewing researchers whether they’re
her prince, finally coming to save her from

00:06:37.740 --> 00:06:38.840
this prison.

00:06:38.840 --> 00:06:44.320
Sadly for 137, her prince will never come,
but perhaps she’ll spend every day looking

00:06:44.320 --> 00:06:49.740
at her own cell door and hoping, being physically
incapable of knowing any better.

00:06:49.740 --> 00:06:53.181
But of course, you’re not here to engage
with the heady existential realities of a

00:06:53.181 --> 00:06:56.050
shape and personality-shifting anomaly.

00:06:56.050 --> 00:07:01.120
Like any reasonable person in this situation,
of course, you want to hear about the experiment

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:06.840
logs, and find out just how far this entity’s
ability to anomalously take the forms of living

00:07:06.840 --> 00:07:08.710
toys can stretch.

00:07:08.710 --> 00:07:14.050
And don’t worry, we won’t disappoint you
on that one, either: SCP-137 has some of the

00:07:14.050 --> 00:07:19.040
most insane testing logs we’ve ever seen,
and we’re going to share them with you right

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:20.040
now.

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:22.480
The last one especially is a real doozy.

00:07:22.480 --> 00:07:27.310
First, overeager researchers made the terrible
decision to introduce a toy plane into the

00:07:27.310 --> 00:07:29.080
testing chamber with SCP-137.

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:32.250
How could this possibly go wrong, right?

00:07:32.250 --> 00:07:38.650
Well, here’s how: The toy plane was possessed
by SCP-137, which transformed it into a full-sized

00:07:38.650 --> 00:07:40.480
F16 jet.

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:45.260
This jet then attempted to fly off while inside
the testing chamber, resulting in it flying

00:07:45.260 --> 00:07:50.639
into the side of the chamber and exploding,
causing a massive amount of damage to Foundation

00:07:50.639 --> 00:07:51.639
property.

00:07:51.639 --> 00:07:57.860
Whenever one of SCP-137’s toy hosts is destroyed,
it returns to being a toy.

00:07:57.860 --> 00:08:02.870
In this case, after the smoke cleared, a small
cluster of broken plastic was laying on the

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:03.870
floor.

00:08:03.870 --> 00:08:08.060
The researchers were then forbidden from testing
any toys with jet engines or missiles.

00:08:08.060 --> 00:08:11.950
But, they didn’t tell them anything about
toy race cars.

00:08:11.950 --> 00:08:15.240
It seemed these researchers really were children
at heart.

00:08:15.240 --> 00:08:19.610
They were amazed when the toy car turned into
a full-sized Ferrari, then plowed into the

00:08:19.610 --> 00:08:21.820
wall at high speeds, exploding.

00:08:21.820 --> 00:08:24.370
Vehicle tests were suspended after this.

00:08:24.370 --> 00:08:27.230
The next test was actually kind of an accident.

00:08:27.230 --> 00:08:32.610
An attending agent had an amusing little keyring
shaped like an alligator when entering the

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:35.250
250-meter range of SCP-137.

00:08:35.250 --> 00:08:39.510
You can probably guess what happened next:
Because the keyring was technically close

00:08:39.510 --> 00:08:46.080
enough to a toy, SCP-137 took it over and
transformed it into a six-meter-long saltwater

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:47.080
crocodile.

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:50.980
It then lashed out, attacking and devouring
nearby researchers.

00:08:50.980 --> 00:08:55.190
Fourteen were dead by the time Foundation
Security Officers managed to safely enter

00:08:55.190 --> 00:08:57.060
the scene and terminate the crocodile.

00:08:57.060 --> 00:09:03.830
At that point, searches were intensified for
all personnel intending on working in SCP-137’s

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:04.950
500-meter danger zone.

00:09:04.950 --> 00:09:09.540
Next, an action figure of an American Soldier,
complete with a toy rifle.

00:09:09.540 --> 00:09:10.810
What do you think happened next?

00:09:10.810 --> 00:09:15.210
If you guessed that this toy became a violent,
full-sized soldier that then went on to murder

00:09:15.210 --> 00:09:20.110
a number of Foundation employees before being
taken out by several Foundation agents, then

00:09:20.110 --> 00:09:24.430
you can take any prize from the middle shelf...just
make sure you don’t bring your prize too

00:09:24.430 --> 00:09:29.400
close to SCP-137, or disaster could strike
again.

00:09:29.400 --> 00:09:33.520
After this, a toy police officer was possessed
by SCP-137.

00:09:33.520 --> 00:09:37.760
He began searching the testing facility for
“perps”, and encouraging the researchers

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:39.630
to stay away from drugs.

00:09:39.630 --> 00:09:44.390
This seemed almost charming, to begin with,
until he pulled out his gun and murdered two

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:46.360
researchers, claiming they were criminals.

00:09:46.360 --> 00:09:51.320
He handcuffed a third before finally being
terminated by Foundation Security Officers.

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:56.650
After this, researchers on the SCP-137 project
decided to veer away from testing on violent

00:09:56.650 --> 00:10:02.130
or dangerous toys, and instead brought in
a stuffed panda - the sweetest and cuddliest

00:10:02.130 --> 00:10:03.570
of all bears.

00:10:03.570 --> 00:10:08.300
Everyone agreed that this would be a pleasant
change when SCP-137 transformed into one of

00:10:08.300 --> 00:10:10.240
the big, adorable beasts.

00:10:10.240 --> 00:10:14.060
One researcher, overjoyed at the presence
of the panda, accepted a hug from it.

00:10:14.060 --> 00:10:19.050
The panda hugged far harder than anticipated,
breaking three of the researcher’s ribs.

00:10:19.050 --> 00:10:23.330
It was terminated by Foundation Security Officers
soon afterward.

00:10:23.330 --> 00:10:29.440
It turned out that the anomalous effects of
SCP-137 also applied to non-sentient toys.

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:34.520
For example, a box filled with lego blocks
became real terracotta bricks and construction

00:10:34.520 --> 00:10:40.270
materials, and a yo-yo - even when placed
on a hook on the wall with nobody nearby - continued

00:10:40.270 --> 00:10:43.560
to perform sick yo-yo tricks with reckless
abandon.

00:10:43.560 --> 00:10:48.800
The penultimate test performed on SCP-137
involved an action figure of a character known

00:10:48.800 --> 00:10:53.089
as Doctor Selenium, advertised as “The Smartest
Man on Earth.”

00:10:53.089 --> 00:10:59.040
However, when SCP-137 transformed this into
a real-life Doctor Selenium, the Foundation

00:10:59.040 --> 00:11:04.470
discovered that SCP-137 couldn’t actually
imitate more ephemeral qualities like incredible

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:05.520
intelligence.

00:11:05.520 --> 00:11:09.940
This Doctor Selenium clone simply walked around,
constantly talking about how intelligent he

00:11:09.940 --> 00:11:13.390
was rather than actually demonstrating that
intelligence.

00:11:13.390 --> 00:11:17.500
He was probably the kind of guy who comments
“first” on YouTube videos.

00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:20.550
And finally, the strangest test of all.

00:11:20.550 --> 00:11:25.190
The Foundation constantly needs to worry about
moles and double-crossers in their midst.

00:11:25.190 --> 00:11:29.029
They have tests to figure out the presence
of double-agents working for Groups of Interest

00:11:29.029 --> 00:11:32.220
like the Chaos Insurgency or the Serpent’s
Hand.

00:11:32.220 --> 00:11:38.580
But one group they didn’t have tests for
were Bronies, adult male fans of the cartoon

00:11:38.580 --> 00:11:42.580
My Little Pony, based on the popular toy series.

00:11:42.580 --> 00:11:50.320
And it just so happened that one of the researchers
on the SCP-137 case was indeed a Brony.

00:11:50.320 --> 00:11:55.580
That’s why he snuck a doll of the purple
pony, Twilight Sparkle, into the testing chamber,

00:11:55.580 --> 00:12:00.140
causing SCP-137 to possess it and turn it
into the real thing.

00:12:00.140 --> 00:12:05.959
He engaged in a somewhat flirtatious conversation
with the talking pony, leading to the pony

00:12:05.959 --> 00:12:11.140
offering to take the researcher back to her
castle so they could hang out.

00:12:11.140 --> 00:12:15.540
After this testing session ended, the researcher
was removed from the project and then reprimanded

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:20.980
by his superiors for using an anomaly to fulfill
his personal interests.

00:12:20.980 --> 00:12:26.089
But working at the Foundation is an incredibly
hard job, with the risk of death lurking around

00:12:26.089 --> 00:12:27.250
every corner.

00:12:27.250 --> 00:12:30.790
So who can really blame the guy for wanting
to hang out with his favorite cartoon character

00:12:30.790 --> 00:12:36.740
between sessions with 096 and 682?

00:12:36.740 --> 00:12:41.800
Which toy would you like SCP-137 to possess
and transform into a real-life counterpart?

00:12:41.800 --> 00:12:43.650
Let us know in the comments below!

00:12:43.650 --> 00:12:48.399
Then go check out “ALL the Little Misters
Explained” and “SCP-136 - Naked Doll”

00:12:48.399 --> 00:12:50.790
for more terrifying anomalous toys!

